{"id":"01d284a727e9120d","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/723_ALCI.md","title":"723 ALCI","display":"723_ALCI","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"723-ALCI\">723 ALCI</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(N_C,N_R)\">\\(\\Sigma=(N_C,N_R)\\)</span>。ALCI 是 ALC 加逆角色的句法系统。</p>\n<p>角色构造子为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rname},\\quad\\operatorname{inv}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{rname},\\quad\\operatorname{inv}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其型别为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rname}:N_R\\to\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{inv}:\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\to\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{rname}:N_R\\to\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{inv}:\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\to\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>概念构造子为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{name},\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom},\n\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{disj},\n\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{name},\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom},\n\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{disj},\n\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其型别为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{name}:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom}\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{name}:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom}\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{disj}:\n\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{disj}:\n\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists}:\n\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists}:\n\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-角色表达式\">2. 角色表达式</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\)</span> 为满足下列条件的最小集合。</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in N_R\">\\(R\\in N_R\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rname}(R)\\in\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\">\\(\\operatorname{rname}(R)\\in\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\">\\(\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{inv}(\\rho)\\in\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\">\\(\\operatorname{inv}(\\rho)\\in\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>显示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{inv}(\\rho)\">\\(\\operatorname{inv}(\\rho)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho^{-}\">\\(\\rho^{-}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义角色双逆归约关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_R\">\\(\\equiv_R\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\)</span> 上满足下列条件的最小等价关系：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\equiv_R\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\equiv_R\\rho\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{inv}(\\operatorname{inv}(\\rho))\\equiv_R\\rho\">\\(\\operatorname{inv}(\\operatorname{inv}(\\rho))\\equiv_R\\rho\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\equiv_R\\sigma\">\\(\\rho\\equiv_R\\sigma\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{inv}(\\rho)\\equiv_R\\operatorname{inv}(\\sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{inv}(\\rho)\\equiv_R\\operatorname{inv}(\\sigma)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-概念表达式\">3. 概念表达式</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\)</span> 为最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top,\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\">\\(\\top,\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in N_C\">\\(A\\in N_C\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{name}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\">\\(\\operatorname{name}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\">\\(\\neg C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\">\\(C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\sqcap D,C\\sqcup D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\">\\(C\\sqcap D,C\\sqcup D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\">\\(\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\rho.C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\">\\(\\forall\\rho.C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\">\\(\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\rho.C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\">\\(\\exists\\rho.C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"4.-包含式与-TBox\">4. 包含式与 TBox</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\n=\n\\{(C,D):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\n=\n\\{(C,D):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>TBox 载体为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TBox}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\n=\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{TBox}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\n=\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-自由名字与替换\">5. 自由名字与替换</h1>\n<p>角色名字函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RN}(\\operatorname{rname}(R))=\\{R\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{RN}(\\rho^{-})=\\operatorname{RN}(\\rho).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RN}(\\operatorname{rname}(R))=\\{R\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{RN}(\\rho^{-})=\\operatorname{RN}(\\rho).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>概念自由名字：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\top)=\\operatorname{FN}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}(A)=\\{A\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\top)=\\operatorname{FN}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}(A)=\\{A\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\neg C)=\\operatorname{FN}(C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\neg C)=\\operatorname{FN}(C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcup D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcup D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\forall\\rho.C)=\\operatorname{RN}(\\rho)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}(\\exists\\rho.C)=\\operatorname{RN}(\\rho)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\forall\\rho.C)=\\operatorname{RN}(\\rho)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}(\\exists\\rho.C)=\\operatorname{RN}(\\rho)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义无绑定名字函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}(X)=\\varnothing\n\\quad(X\\in\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\cup\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BN}(X)=\\varnothing\n\\quad(X\\in\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\cup\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个名字排序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\{N_C,N_R\\}\">\\(S\\in\\{N_C,N_R\\}\\)</span> 固定无重复枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e^S_0,e^S_1,\\ldots\">\\(e^S_0,e^S_1,\\ldots\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq S\">\\(X\\subseteq S\\)</span> 有限，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}(S,X)=e^S_m,\n\\quad\nm=\\min\\{k:e^S_k\\notin X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}(S,X)=e^S_m,\n\\quad\nm=\\min\\{k:e^S_k\\notin X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_C:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\">\\(\\theta_C:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_R:N_R\\to\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\">\\(\\theta_R:N_R\\to\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\)</span>，定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RSub}(\\operatorname{rname}(R))=\\theta_R(R),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{RSub}(\\rho^{-})=(\\operatorname{RSub}(\\rho))^{-}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RSub}(\\operatorname{rname}(R))=\\theta_R(R),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{RSub}(\\rho^{-})=(\\operatorname{RSub}(\\rho))^{-}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>概念替换为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\top)=\\top,\\quad\\operatorname{Sub}(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}(A)=\\theta_C(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(\\top)=\\top,\\quad\\operatorname{Sub}(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}(A)=\\theta_C(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\neg C)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(\\neg C)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{Sub}(C)\\sqcap\\operatorname{Sub}(D),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}(C\\sqcup D)=\\operatorname{Sub}(C)\\sqcup\\operatorname{Sub}(D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{Sub}(C)\\sqcap\\operatorname{Sub}(D),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}(C\\sqcup D)=\\operatorname{Sub}(C)\\sqcup\\operatorname{Sub}(D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\forall\\rho.C)=\\forall\\operatorname{RSub}(\\rho).\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}(\\exists\\rho.C)=\\exists\\operatorname{RSub}(\\rho).\\operatorname{Sub}(C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(\\forall\\rho.C)=\\forall\\operatorname{RSub}(\\rho).\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}(\\exists\\rho.C)=\\exists\\operatorname{RSub}(\\rho).\\operatorname{Sub}(C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\n=\n\\{(C,C):C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\n=\n\\{(C,C):C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall \\rho.C\">\\(\\forall \\rho.C\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists \\rho.C\">\\(\\exists \\rho.C\\)</span> 是角色限制构造子，不绑定概念名或角色名；逆角色构造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{inv}\">\\(\\operatorname{inv}\\)</span> 也不引入绑定名。捕获避免重命名就是保持排序的有限支撑替换，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\">\\(\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\)</span> 只用于选择未出现在有限名字集中的新名字。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-公理集合\">6. 公理集合</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}(\\mathcal T)\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCbase}}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}(\\mathcal T)\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCbase}}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)=\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)=\\mathcal T\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCbase}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCbase}}\\)</span> 为本地 ALC 格公理：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{C\\sqsubseteq C,\\ C\\sqsubseteq\\top,\\ \\bot\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{C\\sqsubseteq C,\\ C\\sqsubseteq\\top,\\ \\bot\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq C,\\ C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq D,\\ C\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup D,\\ D\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq C,\\ C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq D,\\ C\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup D,\\ D\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{C\\sqcap\\neg C\\sqsubseteq\\bot,\\ \\top\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup\\neg C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{C\\sqcap\\neg C\\sqsubseteq\\bot,\\ \\top\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup\\neg C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>逆角色归约公理族定义如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}\n=\n\\{\\forall\\rho.C\\sqsubseteq\\forall\\sigma.C,\\ \\exists\\rho.C\\sqsubseteq\\exists\\sigma.C:\n\\rho,\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\\ \\rho\\equiv_R\\sigma,\\ C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}\n=\n\\{\\forall\\rho.C\\sqsubseteq\\forall\\sigma.C,\\ \\exists\\rho.C\\sqsubseteq\\exists\\sigma.C:\n\\rho,\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\\ \\rho\\equiv_R\\sigma,\\ C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-推理规则\">7. 推理规则</h1>\n<p>定义传递、合取引入、析取消去、底规则关系如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}=\\{(((C,D),(D,E)),(C,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}=\\{(((C,D),(D,E)),(C,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}=\\{(((C,D),(C,E)),(C,D\\sqcap E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}=\\{(((C,D),(C,E)),(C,D\\sqcap E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}=\\{(((C,E),(D,E)),(C\\sqcup D,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}=\\{(((C,E),(D,E)),(C\\sqcup D,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}=\\{(((C,\\bot)),(C,D)):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}=\\{(((C,\\bot)),(C,D)):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>模态单调规则关系如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\n=\\{(((C,D)),(\\forall\\rho.C,\\forall\\rho.D)):\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\n=\\{(((C,D)),(\\forall\\rho.C,\\forall\\rho.D)):\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\n=\\{(((C,D)),(\\exists\\rho.C,\\exists\\rho.D)):\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\n=\\{(((C,D)),(\\exists\\rho.C,\\exists\\rho.D)):\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\n=\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\n=\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-证明对象\">8. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\">\\(I\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\)</span>。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}(\\mathcal T,I)\">\\(\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}(\\mathcal T,I)\\)</span> 为所有非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\">\\(\\pi=(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_i\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\">\\(I_i\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_{m-1}=I\">\\(I_{m-1}=I\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}(\\mathcal T)\">\\(I_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}(\\mathcal T)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\">\\(((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\">\\(((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\">\\(((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义证明谓词：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}(\\mathcal T,(C,D))\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}(\\mathcal T,(C,D))\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-可导出关系\">9. 可导出关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}C\\sqsubseteq D\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}C\\sqsubseteq D\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}(\\mathcal T,(C,D))\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}(\\mathcal T,(C,D))\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-语义结构与解释\">10. 语义结构与解释</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}=\n\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}\\times\\{\\varnothing\\}\\times\\{\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}=\n\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}\\times\\{\\varnothing\\}\\times\\{\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\)</span> 是所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I=(\\Delta,\\iota_C,\\iota_R)\">\\(\\mathcal I=(\\Delta,\\iota_C,\\iota_R)\\)</span> 的集合，满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\ne\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\iota_C:N_C\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta),\\quad\n\\iota_R:N_R\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta\\times\\Delta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta\\ne\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\iota_C:N_C\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta),\\quad\n\\iota_R:N_R\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta\\times\\Delta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>角色解释 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{R}:\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta\\times\\Delta)\">\\(\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{R}:\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta\\times\\Delta)\\)</span> 定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\operatorname{rname}(R)\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{R}=\\iota_R(R),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\operatorname{rname}(R)\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{R}=\\iota_R(R),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\rho^{-}\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{R}\n=\n\\{(y,x):(x,y)\\in\\llbracket\\rho\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{R}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\rho^{-}\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{R}\n=\n\\{(y,x):(x,y)\\in\\llbracket\\rho\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{R}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>概念解释 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\">\\(\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\)</span> 定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\top\\rrbracket=\\Delta,\\quad\n\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\llbracket A\\rrbracket=\\iota_C(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\top\\rrbracket=\\Delta,\\quad\n\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\llbracket A\\rrbracket=\\iota_C(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\neg C\\rrbracket=\\Delta\\setminus\\llbracket C\\rrbracket,\\quad\n\\llbracket C\\sqcap D\\rrbracket=\\llbracket C\\rrbracket\\cap\\llbracket D\\rrbracket,\\quad\n\\llbracket C\\sqcup D\\rrbracket=\\llbracket C\\rrbracket\\cup\\llbracket D\\rrbracket,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\neg C\\rrbracket=\\Delta\\setminus\\llbracket C\\rrbracket,\\quad\n\\llbracket C\\sqcap D\\rrbracket=\\llbracket C\\rrbracket\\cap\\llbracket D\\rrbracket,\\quad\n\\llbracket C\\sqcup D\\rrbracket=\\llbracket C\\rrbracket\\cup\\llbracket D\\rrbracket,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\forall\\rho.C\\rrbracket=\\{x:\\forall y((x,y)\\in\\llbracket\\rho\\rrbracket^{R}\\Rightarrow y\\in\\llbracket C\\rrbracket)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\forall\\rho.C\\rrbracket=\\{x:\\forall y((x,y)\\in\\llbracket\\rho\\rrbracket^{R}\\Rightarrow y\\in\\llbracket C\\rrbracket)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\exists\\rho.C\\rrbracket=\\{x:\\exists y((x,y)\\in\\llbracket\\rho\\rrbracket^{R}\\land y\\in\\llbracket C\\rrbracket)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\exists\\rho.C\\rrbracket=\\{x:\\exists y((x,y)\\in\\llbracket\\rho\\rrbracket^{R}\\land y\\in\\llbracket C\\rrbracket)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"11.-满足关系与语义后承\">11. 满足关系与语义后承</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}C\\sqsubseteq D\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\llbracket C\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\subseteq\n\\llbracket D\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALCI}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}C\\sqsubseteq D\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\llbracket C\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\subseteq\n\\llbracket D\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALCI}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}I\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal K=(\\mathcal T,\\varnothing,\\varnothing)\\land I\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\n((\\forall J\\in\\mathcal T\\ \\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}J)\\Rightarrow\n\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}I).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal K\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}I\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal K=(\\mathcal T,\\varnothing,\\varnothing)\\land I\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\n((\\forall J\\in\\mathcal T\\ \\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}J)\\Rightarrow\n\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}I).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"12.-特征差异\">12. 特征差异</h1>\n<p>ALCI 的目标差异对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\operatorname{inv},\\equiv_R\\},\n\\{\\operatorname{roleIncl},\\operatorname{transRole},\\operatorname{nom},\\operatorname{atLeast},\\operatorname{atMost}\\}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\operatorname{inv},\\equiv_R\\},\n\\{\\operatorname{roleIncl},\\operatorname{transRole},\\operatorname{nom},\\operatorname{atLeast},\\operatorname{atMost}\\}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第一分量要求角色表达式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho^{-}\">\\(\\rho^{-}\\)</span> 与双逆归约 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho^{--}\\equiv_R\\rho\">\\(\\rho^{--}\\equiv_R\\rho\\)</span> 同时出现；全称和存在限制的角色参数类型因此为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"13.-整个形式系统\">13. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\n=\n(N_C,N_R,\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\n\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\n\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\n\\equiv_R,\\operatorname{RN},\\operatorname{FN},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\n\\operatorname{RSub},\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\n\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket^{R},\n\\llbracket-\\rrbracket^{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}\n=\n(N_C,N_R,\\mathsf{Role}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\n\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\n\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\n\\equiv_R,\\operatorname{RN},\\operatorname{FN},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\n\\operatorname{RSub},\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\n\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket^{R},\n\\llbracket-\\rrbracket^{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCI}},\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCI}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统不含角色层级、传递角色、数目限制或名词；语义只解释 ALCI 的逆角色和概念构造子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"723-ALCI","text":"723 ALCI","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-角色表达式","text":"2. 角色表达式","level":1},{"id":"3.-概念表达式","text":"3. 概念表达式","level":1},{"i